1
00:00:15,840 --> 00:00:19,670
You whisper that we must go back,
Where every light is turned to black.

2
00:00:19,828 --> 00:00:23,709
The Sunday mass, the silent street,
And cold garages where we meet.

3
00:00:23,810 --> 00:00:27,941
But I'm a lioness who bites,
I fight and scratch in heavy nights.

4
00:00:28,029 --> 00:00:32,061
No more cages, no more shame,
I scream the power of your name!

5
00:00:39,781 --> 00:00:43,842
I will not love a trembling boy,
Who lets them steal our only joy.

6
00:00:43,921 --> 00:00:47,854
Who shuts his mouth and runs away,
Because he has no words to say.

7
00:00:47,901 --> 00:00:51,983
But I'm a lioness who bites,
I fight and scratch in heavy nights.

8
00:00:52,015 --> 00:00:56,219
No more cages, no more shame,
I scream the power of your name!

9
00:00:59,512 --> 00:01:03,916
Don't give me a weak, shaking yes,
No cowardly and hollow guess.

10
00:01:04,024 --> 00:01:08,225
Look in my eyes and make your choice,
We need the thunder of your voice.

11
00:01:08,284 --> 00:01:14,788
I see the spark, I see the flame,
Your blue eyes turn to amber gold.

12
00:01:16,163 --> 00:01:22,950
You speak the oath, you take the claim,
We will not play the cards they hold.

13
00:01:27,813 --> 00:01:31,784
We are a pack, we are the fire,
Higher than their church's spire.

14
00:01:31,841 --> 00:01:36,072
The roaring waters start to flow,
We'll never let each other go!

